WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.000
Narrator: Half-time.

2
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:06.200
Narrator: A man sits down on the stairs.

3
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:10.700
Narrator: He looks grey and sweaty, and people just walk past.

4
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.500
Narrator: Then he slumps.

5
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:25.300
Narrator: Faisal is the nearest marshal.

6
00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:31.800
Narrator: In the next minute, what Faisal does matters more than anything else he'll do today.

